# Un-ignore project directives, skills, and graph report (overriding global gitignore)
!CLAUDE.md
!.claude/
!.claude/**
!graphify-out/
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md

# Source PDFs (proprietary rulebook, exceeds GitHub 100MB file limit)
*.pdf

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Temp & OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
